		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Eight crooked, vermilion arms extend from a scintillating energy orb. Whispers of manifold past and future selves haunt the air around this aeon.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 18, <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +4 (1d6 + fate drain) or fate blast, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fate Blast</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending near from theletos. WIS 15+ or cursed with DISADV on all rolls for 1d6 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fate Drain</strong>. WIS 15+ or target either loses a luck token or takes 1d6 CHA damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
